{"seq":2,"slug":"scope-functions","title":"作用域函数","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/kotlin-advanced/functional-patterns/scope-functions","wordCount":701,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"作用域函数\">作用域函数</h1><p>Kotlin 提供了五个作用域函数——<code>let</code>、<code>run</code>、<code>with</code>、<code>apply</code>、<code>also</code>——用于在对象的上下文中执行代码块。它们的核心区别在于上下文引用方式（<code>this</code> vs <code>it</code>）和返回值（上下文对象 vs lambda 结果）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>作用域函数的核心是<strong>两个正交维度的组合</strong>：上下文引用方式（<code>this</code> 还是 <code>it</code>）与返回值（上下文对象还是 lambda 结果）。<code>let</code>/<code>run</code>/<code>with</code>/<code>apply</code>/<code>also</code> 正是这两种选择的全排列。掌握它们的差异之后，「用哪个」就退化成一个由「要不要链式返回对象」和「需不需要 <code>it</code> 命名」决定的确定性问题。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"五大作用域函数对比\">五大作用域函数对比</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>函数</th>\n<th>上下文引用</th>\n<th>返回值</th>\n<th>调用方式</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>let</code></td>\n<td><code>it</code></td>\n<td>Lambda 结果</td>\n<td>扩展函数</td>\n<td>空安全调用、转换</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>run</code></td>\n<td><code>this</code></td>\n<td>Lambda 结果</td>\n<td>扩展函数</td>\n<td>对象配置 + 计算结果</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>with</code></td>\n<td><code>this</code></td>\n<td>Lambda 结果</td>\n<td>普通函数</td>\n<td>对已有对象调用多个方法</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>apply</code></td>\n<td><code>this</code></td>\n<td>上下文对象</td>\n<td>扩展函数</td>\n<td>对象初始化配置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>also</code></td>\n<td><code>it</code></td>\n<td>上下文对象</td>\n<td>扩展函数</td>\n<td>附加操作（日志、验证）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[选择作用域函数] --&gt; B{需要返回什么?}&#10;    B --&gt;|Lambda 结果| C{上下文引用方式?}&#10;    B --&gt;|对象本身| D{上下文引用方式?}&#10;    C --&gt;|this| E[run / with]&#10;    C --&gt;|it| F[let]&#10;    D --&gt;|this| G[apply]&#10;    D --&gt;|it| H[also]\">flowchart TD\n    A[选择作用域函数] --&gt; B{需要返回什么?}\n    B --&gt;|Lambda 结果| C{上下文引用方式?}\n    B --&gt;|对象本身| D{上下文引用方式?}\n    C --&gt;|this| E[run / with]\n    C --&gt;|it| F[let]\n    D --&gt;|this| G[apply]\n    D --&gt;|it| H[also]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"let\">let</h2><p>使用 <code>it</code> 引用上下文对象，返回 lambda 结果。最常用于空安全调用链：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"val name: String? = &quot;Kotlin&quot;&#10;&#10;// 空安全调用&#10;val length = name?.let { it.length } ?: 0&#10;&#10;// 转换&#10;val result = listOf(1, 2, 3).firstOrNull()?.let { &quot;找到: $it&quot; } ?: &quot;未找到&quot;&#10;&#10;// 限制变量作用域&#10;val numbers = mutableListOf(&quot;one&quot;, &quot;two&quot;, &quot;three&quot;)&#10;numbers.map { it.length }.filter { it &gt; 3 }.let { println(it) }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>val name: String? = \"Kotlin\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 空安全调用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val length = name?.let { it.length } ?: 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 转换</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val result = listOf(1, 2, 3).firstOrNull()?.let { \"找到: $it\" } ?: \"未找到\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 限制变量作用域</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val numbers = mutableListOf(\"one\", \"two\", \"three\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>numbers.map { it.length }.filter { it > 3 }.let { println(it) }</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"run\">run</h2><p>使用 <code>this</code> 引用上下文对象，返回 lambda 结果。适合配置对象后计算结果：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"val service = DatabaseService()&#10;&#10;val result = service.run {&#10;    host = &quot;localhost&quot;&#10;    port = 5432&#10;    connect()&#10;    query(&quot;SELECT * FROM users&quot;) // 返回值&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 非扩展形式：用于执行需要表达式的代码块&#10;val hexColor = run {&#10;    val r = 255&#10;    val g = 128&#10;    val b = 0&#10;    &quot;#${r.toString(16)}${g.toString(16)}${b.toString(16)}&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>val service = DatabaseService()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val result = service.run {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    host = \"localhost\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    port = 5432</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    connect()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    query(\"SELECT * FROM users\") // 返回值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 非扩展形式：用于执行需要表达式的代码块</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val hexColor = run {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val r = 255</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val g = 128</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val b = 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    \"#${r.toString(16)}${g.toString(16)}${b.toString(16)}\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"with\">with</h2><p>使用 <code>this</code> 引用，返回 lambda 结果。与 <code>run</code> 类似，但以普通函数形式调用：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"val builder = StringBuilder()&#10;&#10;val text = with(builder) {&#10;    append(&quot;Hello&quot;)&#10;    append(&quot;, &quot;)&#10;    append(&quot;World!&quot;)&#10;    toString() // 返回值&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 适合对同一对象调用多个方法&#10;with(config) {&#10;    enableFeatureA()&#10;    setMaxRetries(3)&#10;    setTimeout(5000)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>val builder = StringBuilder()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val text = with(builder) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    append(\"Hello\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    append(\", \")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    append(\"World!\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    toString() // 返回值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 适合对同一对象调用多个方法</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>with(config) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    enableFeatureA()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    setMaxRetries(3)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    setTimeout(5000)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> <code>with</code> 不是扩展函数，因此不支持空安全调用（<code>?.</code>）。对于可空对象，优先使用 <code>run</code>。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"apply\">apply</h2><p>使用 <code>this</code> 引用，返回对象本身。最适合对象初始化和配置：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"val user = User().apply {&#10;    name = &quot;张三&quot;&#10;    age = 28&#10;    email = &quot;zhangsan@example.com&quot;&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 典型场景：构建 Intent&#10;val intent = Intent(context, DetailActivity::class.java).apply {&#10;    putExtra(&quot;id&quot;, userId)&#10;    putExtra(&quot;source&quot;, &quot;home&quot;)&#10;    addFlags(Intent.FLAG_ACTIVITY_NEW_TASK)&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 链式配置&#10;val paint = Paint().apply {&#10;    color = Color.RED&#10;    strokeWidth = 2f&#10;    style = Paint.Style.STROKE&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>val user = User().apply {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    name = \"张三\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    age = 28</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    email = \"zhangsan@example.com\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 典型场景：构建 Intent</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val intent = Intent(context, DetailActivity::class.java).apply {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    putExtra(\"id\", userId)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    putExtra(\"source\", \"home\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    addFlags(Intent.FLAG_ACTIVITY_NEW_TASK)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 链式配置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val paint = Paint().apply {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    color = Color.RED</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    strokeWidth = 2f</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    style = Paint.Style.STROKE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"also\">also</h2><p>使用 <code>it</code> 引用，返回对象本身。适合执行不修改对象的附加操作：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"val numbers = mutableListOf(1, 2, 3)&#10;    .also { println(&quot;初始列表: $it&quot;) }&#10;    .also { require(it.isNotEmpty()) { &quot;列表不能为空&quot; } }&#10;&#10;// 调试和日志&#10;fun fetchUser(id: Long): User {&#10;    return repository.findById(id)&#10;        .also { println(&quot;查询到用户: $it&quot;) }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 链式操作中插入副作用&#10;val sorted = mutableListOf(3, 1, 4, 1, 5)&#10;    .also { println(&quot;排序前: $it&quot;) }&#10;    .apply { sort() }&#10;    .also { println(&quot;排序后: $it&quot;) }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>val numbers = mutableListOf(1, 2, 3)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    .also { println(\"初始列表: $it\") }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    .also { require(it.isNotEmpty()) { \"列表不能为空\" } }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 调试和日志</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun fetchUser(id: Long): User {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return repository.findById(id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .also { println(\"查询到用户: $it\") }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 链式操作中插入副作用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val sorted = mutableListOf(3, 1, 4, 1, 5)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    .also { println(\"排序前: $it\") }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    .apply { sort() }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    .also { println(\"排序后: $it\") }</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"组合使用\">组合使用</h2><p>作用域函数可以组合形成流畅的调用链：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"data class Request(&#10;    var url: String = &quot;&quot;,&#10;    var method: String = &quot;GET&quot;,&#10;    var headers: MutableMap&lt;String, String&gt; = mutableMapOf(),&#10;    var body: String? = null&#10;)&#10;&#10;fun buildRequest(): Request {&#10;    return Request().apply {&#10;        url = &quot;https://api.example.com/users&quot;&#10;        method = &quot;POST&quot;&#10;        headers[&quot;Content-Type&quot;] = &quot;application/json&quot;&#10;        body = &quot;&quot;&quot;{&quot;name&quot;: &quot;张三&quot;}&quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;    }.also {&#10;        println(&quot;构建请求: ${it.method} ${it.url}&quot;)&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>data class Request(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    var url: String = \"\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    var method: String = \"GET\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    var headers: MutableMap&#x3C;String, String> = mutableMapOf(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    var body: String? = null</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun buildRequest(): Request {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return Request().apply {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        url = \"https://api.example.com/users\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        method = \"POST\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        headers[\"Content-Type\"] = \"application/json\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        body = \"\"\"{\"name\": \"张三\"}\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }.also {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        println(\"构建请求: ${it.method} ${it.url}\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"链式模式的选择指南\">链式模式的选择指南</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// ❌ 过度嵌套 — 可读性差&#10;user?.let {&#10;    it.address?.let { addr -&gt;&#10;        addr.city?.let { city -&gt;&#10;            println(city)&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// ✅ 扁平链式&#10;val city = user?.address?.city&#10;city?.let { println(it) }&#10;&#10;// ✅ 合理组合&#10;val connection = DatabaseConfig().apply {&#10;    host = &quot;localhost&quot;&#10;    port = 5432&#10;}.run {&#10;    createConnection()&#10;}.also {&#10;    logger.info(&quot;数据库已连接&quot;)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// ❌ 过度嵌套 — 可读性差</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>user?.let {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    it.address?.let { addr -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        addr.city?.let { city -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            println(city)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// ✅ 扁平链式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val city = user?.address?.city</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>city?.let { println(it) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// ✅ 合理组合</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val connection = DatabaseConfig().apply {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    host = \"localhost\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    port = 5432</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}.run {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    createConnection()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}.also {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    logger.info(\"数据库已连接\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>推荐函数</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>空安全转换</td>\n<td><code>let</code></td>\n<td><code>?.let</code> 优雅处理可空</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对象初始化</td>\n<td><code>apply</code></td>\n<td>返回对象本身，支持链式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>插入日志/验证</td>\n<td><code>also</code></td>\n<td>不影响链式返回值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对象配置+获取结果</td>\n<td><code>run</code></td>\n<td>返回计算结果</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对已有对象分组调用</td>\n<td><code>with</code></td>\n<td>减少重复引用</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"内部实现\">内部实现</h2><p>所有作用域函数都是 <code>inline</code> 的，没有运行时开销：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// let 的实际签名&#10;public inline fun &lt;T, R&gt; T.let(block: (T) -&gt; R): R = block(this)&#10;&#10;// apply 的实际签名&#10;public inline fun &lt;T&gt; T.apply(block: T.() -&gt; Unit): T {&#10;    block()&#10;    return this&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// let 的实际签名</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public inline fun &#x3C;T, R> T.let(block: (T) -> R): R = block(this)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// apply 的实际签名</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public inline fun &#x3C;T> T.apply(block: T.() -> Unit): T {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    block()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return this</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 因为是 inline 函数，作用域函数的 lambda 中可以使用 <code>return</code> 执行非局部返回。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>let</strong>：<code>it</code> 引用 + 返回 lambda 结果，适合空安全调用和转换</li>\n<li><strong>run</strong>：<code>this</code> 引用 + 返回 lambda 结果，适合对象配置后计算</li>\n<li><strong>with</strong>：<code>this</code> 引用 + 返回 lambda 结果，适合对已有对象批量调用方法</li>\n<li><strong>apply</strong>：<code>this</code> 引用 + 返回对象本身，适合对象初始化配置</li>\n<li><strong>also</strong>：<code>it</code> 引用 + 返回对象本身，适合附加操作（日志、验证）</li>\n<li>所有作用域函数都是 <code>inline</code> 的，零运行时开销</li>\n<li>避免过度嵌套，保持链式调用的扁平和可读性</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"作用域函数","id":"作用域函数"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"五大作用域函数对比","id":"五大作用域函数对比"},{"level":2,"text":"let","id":"let"},{"level":2,"text":"run","id":"run"},{"level":2,"text":"with","id":"with"},{"level":2,"text":"apply","id":"apply"},{"level":2,"text":"also","id":"also"},{"level":2,"text":"组合使用","id":"组合使用"},{"level":2,"text":"链式模式的选择指南","id":"链式模式的选择指南"},{"level":2,"text":"内部实现","id":"内部实现"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"高阶函数","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/kotlin-advanced/functional-patterns/higher-order-functions"},"next":{"title":"序列","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/kotlin-advanced/functional-patterns/sequences"}}